cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow kit in your research or tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Workflow Kit"
authors:
  - family-names: "asimfish"
repository-code: "https://github.com/asimfish/agent-workflow-kit"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - multi-agent-coordination
  - workflow
  - gpu-supervision
  - code-review
abstract: >-
  A project-level workflow kit for AI coding agents: durable task documents,
  multi-session coordination with fail-closed identity and lease semantics,
  supervised background runs with GPU idle reclamation, bounded feedback
  loops, and an independent review gate enforced across Codex, Claude Code,
  and Cursor.
